        "text": "Local Services Ads, often shortened to LSAs, are a separate Google advertising product from the regular Google Ads search campaigns most practices have heard of. They appear at the very top of results for certain local searches, usually showing the business name, rating, hours and a call button. Google also runs a screening process and may show a badge once a business passes it."
